WEBVTT

00:07:56.886 --> 00:08:00.019
they made an entire nation
start to second-guess themselves

00:08:00.043 --> 00:08:01.193
about saying it.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:06.824
This was such a radical move

00:08:06.848 --> 00:08:09.015
that people are still mad about it.

00:08:10.617 --> 00:08:15.499
Critics accuse those of us
who use the phrase "the N-word,"

00:08:15.523 --> 00:08:17.674
or people who become outraged,

00:08:17.698 --> 00:08:19.864
you know, just because the word is said,

00:08:19.888 --> 00:08:21.967
of being overprincipled,

00:08:21.991 --> 00:08:23.633
politically correct

00:08:23.657 --> 00:08:26.752
or, as I just read a couple of weeks ago
in The New York Times,

00:08:26.776 --> 00:08:28.109
"insufferably woke."

00:08:28.657 --> 00:08:30.013
Right?